    "f_e269ce5c": "Medical Monoblade · 2d6 (ignores half SP)\nAirhypo of tranquilizer",
    "f_0c24089e": "Subdermal Armor, SP 11",
    "f_4f726d8c": "Cyberarm (x2) with Tool Hands and Scalpel Fingers\nCybereyes with MicroOptics and TeleOptics\nNeural Link with Sandevistan (he uses it to work faster)",
    "f_5ba6d046": "Lost his licence in Berlin for \"creative\" surgery. In Night City nobody asks for a licence.",
    "f_a8e0a725": "Sells harvested cyberware and organs to the Chrome Vultures, who sell them on to Halcyon Biotics' research wing."
